  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/07/P11207741.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">(64 fotos y cartel de actos) Argelita est&aacute; viviendo este fin de semana una intensa actividad cultural, organizada por el Ayuntamiento, con su alcalde Aitor Balfag&oacute;n Bartoll a la cabeza. </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/07/ArgelitaSabado25domingo26.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 679px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Exposiciones, mercadillo de arte, visitas a la torre museo, talleres, teatro (noche de s&aacute;bado y domingo tarde), combinadas con cena popular y disco m&oacute;vil.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finsemanaculturalargelita/p1120753.jpg\" alt=\"p1120753\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finsemanaculturalargelita/p1120755.jpg\" alt=\"p1120755\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finsemanaculturalargelita/p1120756.jpg\" alt=\"p1120756\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finsemanaculturalargelita/p1120758.jpg\" alt=\"p1120758\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finsemanaculturalargelita/p1120759.jpg\" alt=\"p1120759\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finsemanaculturalargelita/p1120760.jpg\" alt=\"p1120760\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finsemanaculturalargelita/p1120761.jpg\" alt=\"p1120761\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /